{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"0fb6717573a94b232388d98ad4b76cd951ebb7f62424aa4d2b05ece23ced2e48","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这封信来自保罗、西拉和提摩太，写给帖撒罗尼迦属于父上帝和主耶稣基督里的教会。愿恩典平安与你们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我们始终因你们众人而感谢上帝，祷告的时候从未遗忘你们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在我们的父上帝面前，我们记得如何在工作中，投入了你们对上帝的信，如何以爱辛勤工作、如何心怀希望耐心等待我们的主耶稣基督。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["兄弟姐妹们，我们已经知道上帝爱你们，你们对他而言很特别。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我们传递给你们的福音，不只是言语，其中也有力量，因为圣灵彻底说服了你们。通过同样的方式，你们知道了我们是什么样的人，因为我们向你们显示出，我们是为你们而工作。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["当你们接收到这讯息，你们就效法我们，效法主。因为尽管经历苦难，你们仍然体会到圣灵带来的欢喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因此，你们已经成为马其顿和希腊所有信徒的榜样！",{"noteId":0}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们已经宣讲了上帝的信息，不止在马其顿和希腊，还包括听闻你们信上帝的所有人，所以我们不用再对任何人说什么。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["事实上，他们说起了你们如何热情地接待我们；如何摒弃神像、归向上帝；如何在侍奉这活着的真正上帝时，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等候其儿子从天降临——这就是耶稣，上帝使他从死人中复活，在即将到来的审判中拯救我们。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“亚该亚”，又见第 8 段。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/COL/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}